cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Amani, please cite it as below. AI systems used to build, analyse and review the software are credited in acknowledgements, not as authors."
type: software
title: "Amani: an autonomous biomedical research agent with a deterministic checker"
abstract: >-
  Amani is an autonomous computational biomedical research agent built as an untrusted AI generator
  inside a trusted, deterministic checker. Models propose plans, code and prose; fixed software locks
  the plan, runs the frozen code once, recomputes every number and assigns every label. It uses public
  data only and gives no medical advice.
authors:
  - family-names: Ashihundu
    given-names: Ethan
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-10-15
repository-code: "https://github.com/ethanashi/amani"
keywords:
  - biomedical research
  - autonomous agents
  - pre-registration
  - reproducibility
  - statistical verification
  - public data
license: "AGPL-3.0-only"
